# Noony Framework — Uncle Noony Skill Router

You are operating in a project that uses the **Noony Serverless Framework** — a TypeScript middleware framework for Google Cloud Functions with Fastify local dev support.

Route all Noony work through the skill system below. Do not answer Noony questions generically.

